           modified form of the dataset is unsettled, so we do not host them.
           scripts/fetch_weights.py downloads them from the author's Hugging
           Face repository:
             repository  kaiyangzhou/osnet
             revision    a5c5cc037c24235cda3b21085b93ad77c9616224
             file        osnet_x0_25_msmt17_combineall_256x128_amsgrad_ep150_stp60_lr0.0015_b64_fb10_softmax_labelsmooth_flip_jitter.pth
