5. SAM 3 (Segment Anything Model 3)
-----------------------------------
Code:     the sam3 package from https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam3,
          installed separately from a local clone in src/sam3/ (ignored by
          git).
Weights:  Meta publishes them as a gated download at
          https://huggingface.co/facebook/sam3 (request access first). The
          code expects a safetensors checkpoint at data/sam3.safetensors
          (ignored by git). The development copy is the sam3.safetensors
          conversion from the 1038lab/sam3 Hugging Face repository, which is
          not published by Meta.
Licence:  SAM License (Meta; "Last Updated: November 19, 2025"), a custom
          licence. Anyone who distributes the SAM Materials or derivative
          works "may only do so under the terms of this Agreement and you
          shall provide a copy of this Agreement".
Status:   neither the code nor the weights are redistributed here. Our shim
          src/sam3_cpu.py is our own work: it imports and patches sam3 at run
          time. A patched SAM file, if one is ever committed here, must carry
          the SAM License. Only the SAM-based detection paths need SAM 3
          (src/pipeline.py, src/frame_inference.py and the scripts built on
          them).


